  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "秋游\n\n    同学们，11月25号星期六我们要去秋游！这次我们去香山看红叶。\n    请大家25号早上8点到学校，不要迟到。因为要爬山，所以请大家穿上好走路的鞋子，带上水。",
    "traditional": "秋遊\n\n    同學們，11月25號星期六我們要去秋遊！這次我們去香山看紅葉。\n    請大家25號早上8點到學校，不要遲到。因為要爬山，所以請大家穿上好走路的鞋子，帶上水。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Autumn Excursion"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "同学们，11月25号星期六我们要去秋游！",
      "traditional": "同學們，11月25號星期六我們要去秋遊！",
      "pinyin": "tóng xué men 2 yuè 3 hào xīng qī liù wǒ men yào qù qiū yóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "这次我们去香山看红叶。",
      "traditional": "這次我們去香山看紅葉。",
      "pinyin": "zhè cì wǒ men qù xiāng shān kàn hóng yè",
      "english": "Fellow classmates, on Saturday November 25th we will go on an autumn excursion!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This time we will go to Fragrance Hill to watch the autumn leaves."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "请大家25号早上8点到学校，不要迟到。",
      "traditional": "請大家25號早上8點到學校，不要遲到。",
      "pinyin": "qǐng dà jiā 3 hào zǎo shang 1 diǎn dào xué xiào bú yào chí dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "因为要爬山，所以请大家穿上好走路的鞋子，带上水。",
      "traditional": "因為要爬山，所以請大家穿上好走路的鞋子，帶上水。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi yào pá shān suǒ yǐ qǐng dà jiā chuān shang hǎo zǒu lù de xié zi dài shàng shuǐ",
      "english": "We ask everyone to come to school at 8 in the morning on the 25th, and not to be late."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Because we will go hiking, please wear good walking shoes and bring water."
    }
  ],
